  "description": "Ho-Jin has long harbored a deep affection for Gil-Tae, the kind neighbor who has looked after him since childhood. Unable to confess his true feelings, Ho-Jin’s clumsy one-sided love remains a secret, until one night he finds himself masturbating over a drunken, sleeping Gil-Tae. Despite the significant age gap, what began as a hidden desire is about to cross a line from which there is no turning back, forever changing the innocent bond they once shared. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
